license: MIT
keywords:
  - OpenUSD
  - STEP AP242
  - semantic PMI
  - annotation associativity
  - CAD interoperability
  - digital twin
abstract: >-
  Specification, reference STEP-to-USD writer, and full-set audit for a minimal
  standards-only carrier profile that gives semantic PMI (tolerances, datums, and
  their links to geometry) a machine-readable representation in OpenUSD, validated
  on the NIST MBE PMI test models.
